the distant slopes of the mountain, way out of harm's way.  Cracked pools of
solid pools of ice lie off to the west, making a walk across there too
dangerous.  Only the way across the edge of the snow covered valley and a path
toward the north of the snowy plains are left open to take as the snow beats
upon all relentlessly from above.
"
"steep mountain south
